  "solution": "Factor the common term \\((2x+3)\\):\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)(x-4)+(2x+3)(x-6)=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)\\big((x-4)+(x-6)\\big)=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)(2x-10)=0\n\\]\n\nSo the roots are:\n\n\\[\n2x+3=0 \\implies x=-\\frac{3}{2}\n\\]\n\nand\n\n\\[\n2x-10=0 \\implies x=5\n\\]\n\nTheir sum is:\n\n\\[\n-\\frac{3}{2}+5=\\frac{7}{2}\n\\]\n\nThe answer is \\(\\frac{7}{2}\\).",
